Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:14:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 45/48] Sim: the text generator, second pass - grammar (places
 in sentences, subjects, a/an, tags, capitals, the chronicle's own wording)
 and conversations of up to four turns: opener, an answer with a tone, the
 speaker's follow-up to it, and a close (a real how-have-you-been or a goodbye
 in their race's voice); good and grim news answered differently

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JU37XfnHTvru3VVz2sNN7z
